WEBVTT

01:21.370 --> 01:26.910
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.640 --> 01:29.770
[Episode 24]

01:29.970 --> 01:32.920
[Chen Mansion]

01:33.020 --> 01:35.160
[Ancestral Virtues, Our Guiding Light]

01:36.789 --> 01:39.000
Keep this wine warmed in hot water.

01:39.789 --> 01:41.200
The weather is getting colder now.

01:41.200 --> 01:43.060
We can't drink cold wine anymore.

01:44.280 --> 01:45.870
And take those flowers away.

01:45.870 --> 01:47.130
They are out of season.

01:47.150 --> 01:47.820
Hupo.

01:48.310 --> 01:48.920
Have someone

01:48.920 --> 01:50.759
to pick some osmanthus branches
and put them in a vase.

01:50.759 --> 01:51.680
They'll look lovely

01:51.680 --> 01:52.789
and smell wonderful.

01:52.789 --> 01:55.039
Scatter a few petals
in the washbasin as well.

01:55.039 --> 01:56.920
It'll give off a natural fragrance.

01:56.920 --> 01:59.920
You just got back and you're
already busying yourself.

01:59.920 --> 02:01.400
Why not get some rest?

02:05.680 --> 02:06.230
Mother.

02:06.510 --> 02:07.150
Sister.

02:08.039 --> 02:09.630
[Qin Xianlan —
Second Madam of the Chen Family]

02:08.280 --> 02:09.030
I heard

02:09.030 --> 02:10.289
Yanyun is coming back.

02:10.520 --> 02:11.430
Seeing the servants

02:11.430 --> 02:12.750
doing a poor job of tidying up,

02:12.750 --> 02:14.350
I couldn't help stepping in.

02:15.430 --> 02:17.150
You've got a real talent
for arranging things.

02:17.150 --> 02:18.079
The balance of ornament

02:18.079 --> 02:18.910
and empty space is just right.

02:18.910 --> 02:20.570
It's truly fresh and elegant.

02:22.079 --> 02:24.140
Thank you for the compliment.

02:24.400 --> 02:25.470
When I was

02:25.470 --> 02:26.680
at the Shaanxi yamen,

02:26.680 --> 02:27.630
no matter how many different ways

02:27.630 --> 02:28.680
I decorated it,

02:29.120 --> 02:29.960
people there

02:30.079 --> 02:31.790
would only say:

02:32.150 --> 02:33.430
beautiful.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.360
You cheeky monkey.

02:35.590 --> 02:36.750
The house gets lively

02:36.750 --> 02:38.110
once you're back.

02:39.360 --> 02:39.870
Mother.

02:43.430 --> 02:44.000
Yanwen.

02:44.000 --> 02:44.560
Mother.

02:45.190 --> 02:45.750
Xianlan.

02:46.190 --> 02:46.750
Sister.

02:47.590 --> 02:49.360
Is Lady Wang still sick?

02:49.840 --> 02:50.280
Yes.

02:50.470 --> 02:51.470
She's still got a bit of a cough,

02:51.470 --> 02:52.560
so I didn't ask her to come,

02:52.560 --> 02:54.710
so she wouldn't
pass the illness on to you.

02:54.710 --> 02:57.030
Why didn't Yanzhang come this time?

02:59.079 --> 03:00.430
You know him.

03:00.750 --> 03:02.630
He's always so devoted.

03:03.150 --> 03:04.430
I told him

03:04.430 --> 03:05.630
it's been two years

03:05.630 --> 03:06.890
since we all left home.

03:06.910 --> 03:08.820
If he wants to serve the country,

03:08.910 --> 03:09.970
fine, let him stay.

03:10.120 --> 03:11.380
As for me, I don't care.

03:11.800 --> 03:13.000
I'm going back to the capital

03:13.000 --> 03:14.400
to take care of Mother

03:14.590 --> 03:16.120
and fulfill my filial duty.

03:21.960 --> 03:23.610
Why isn't Yanyun here yet?

03:24.140 --> 03:26.200
Didn't they just say he was on his way?

03:30.030 --> 03:31.310
Where is your Master?

03:31.560 --> 03:32.240
Old Madam,

03:32.360 --> 03:33.630
Third Master has gone to Baoxiang Temple.

03:33.630 --> 03:35.120
He asked the Old Madam, Second Madam,

03:35.120 --> 03:36.650
and Sixth Miss to eat first.

03:36.680 --> 03:38.410
There is no need to wait for him.

03:43.430 --> 03:46.110
Why did he suddenly go to Baoxiang Temple?

03:46.430 --> 03:47.240
He didn't even send someone back

03:47.240 --> 03:48.910
to tell us in advance.

03:49.310 --> 03:51.720
The whole family has been waiting for him.

03:52.430 --> 03:54.280
Yanyun has been
the Grand Secretary for so long.

03:54.280 --> 03:56.410
He's used to having people wait on him.

03:57.900 --> 04:00.120
But it's not right
to keep Xianlan waiting.

04:00.120 --> 04:01.790
It's not about right or wrong.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.150
We are family.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.750
Besides,

04:05.190 --> 04:06.850
he just came out of that place.

04:07.310 --> 04:09.310
It makes sense for him
to go to Baoxiang Temple

04:09.310 --> 04:10.430
to offer incense and

04:10.430 --> 04:11.560
pray to the Bodhisattva,

04:11.560 --> 04:12.960
to get rid of the bad luck.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.050
You're right.

04:15.310 --> 04:17.440
That was the prison of the Penal Court.

04:18.160 --> 04:18.839
Mother,

04:19.310 --> 04:21.500
why don't you and sister go ahead

04:21.750 --> 04:23.040
and take your seats for the meal.

04:23.040 --> 04:25.300
I'll change my clothes and be right over.

04:25.510 --> 04:26.070
Alright.

04:39.680 --> 04:41.070
To bring down Fan Chuan,

04:41.430 --> 04:42.690
he actually went so far

04:42.800 --> 04:44.360
as to replace 12,000 tons
of disaster relief grain

04:44.360 --> 04:45.390
with bran.

04:47.240 --> 04:48.840
Fan Chuan has indeed fallen.

04:49.800 --> 04:50.510
But

04:51.070 --> 04:52.800
what did the refugees do wrong?

04:54.360 --> 04:55.159
It only shows that

04:55.159 --> 04:57.000
when someone as capable as mentor

04:57.000 --> 04:58.530
becomes absorbed in power,

04:59.390 --> 05:01.320
the harm they can cause is a hundred

05:01.750 --> 05:04.080
or even a thousand times greater than that

05:04.390 --> 05:05.790
of those without talent.

05:11.870 --> 05:14.330
I came to understand it
while I was in prison.

05:14.430 --> 05:16.290
Neither Fan Chuan, Wang Xuanfan,

05:16.920 --> 05:17.750
or my mentor,

05:18.830 --> 05:20.030
are my kind of people.

05:21.070 --> 05:21.510
But

05:21.510 --> 05:23.600
you are a student
of the Senior Grand Secretary.

05:23.600 --> 05:25.000
If you part ways with him,

05:25.680 --> 05:26.560
I'm afraid

05:26.870 --> 05:28.510
you'll face a lot of criticism.

05:28.510 --> 05:29.000
Yes.

05:29.750 --> 05:30.830
The path ahead of me

05:31.630 --> 05:33.290
will certainly be difficult.

05:34.390 --> 05:35.510
What do you mean?

05:35.940 --> 05:38.740
Are you trying to persuade me
to stay away from you?

05:39.159 --> 05:40.240
What are you panicking for?

05:40.240 --> 05:41.570
I'm not clinging to you.

05:56.040 --> 05:57.920
I actually want you to cling to me.

06:09.310 --> 06:10.000
But

06:11.360 --> 06:11.870
I also have to

06:11.870 --> 06:13.400
consider the risks for you.

06:15.630 --> 06:17.490
So what exactly have you decided?

06:19.560 --> 06:20.290
Come with me.

06:32.120 --> 06:33.130
What is this?

06:34.000 --> 06:35.860
I already have plenty of jewelry.

06:36.270 --> 06:36.950
Open it.

06:42.630 --> 06:44.430
Letter of amicable separation?

06:44.510 --> 06:45.370
Who is this for?

06:46.000 --> 06:46.730
It's for you.

06:47.720 --> 06:49.120
Unfold it and take a look.

06:50.190 --> 06:51.690
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

06:51.770 --> 06:55.120
[Original Nature]

06:58.480 --> 07:02.740
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

06:59.000 --> 07:00.430
The marital bond

07:00.430 --> 07:01.870
is deep and profound.

07:04.510 --> 07:06.270
Since when are we husband and wife?

07:06.270 --> 07:07.470
I'm not reading this.

07:08.190 --> 07:09.520
Come on, read a bit more.

07:10.270 --> 07:11.600
I drafted it four times

07:12.560 --> 07:14.620
while I was in the Penal Court prison.

07:23.000 --> 07:24.830
All land, property,
clothing, and provisions

07:24.830 --> 07:27.090
shall be fully used to make restitution.

07:27.630 --> 07:29.290
A list is attached hereafter.

07:30.560 --> 07:32.680
All my words and deeds,
whether right or wrong,

07:32.680 --> 07:34.750
shall have no connection with my wife.

07:34.750 --> 07:36.610
Let this document serve as proof.

07:40.650 --> 07:41.740
I have stamped it,

07:42.050 --> 07:43.850
but I haven't filled in the date.

07:44.560 --> 07:46.520
You can fill it in whenever you want.

07:46.520 --> 07:48.330
[Chen Yanyun]

07:47.190 --> 07:48.270
In that case,

07:48.870 --> 07:50.220
if I ever run into danger

07:50.320 --> 07:51.840
at court in the future,

07:53.070 --> 07:53.510
you can

07:53.510 --> 07:54.940
take this,

07:55.360 --> 07:56.290
fill in the date,

07:57.010 --> 07:58.110
and leave without

07:58.130 --> 07:59.590
having to consult anyone.

08:00.120 --> 08:01.000
Or,

08:01.970 --> 08:03.230
if you grow tired of me,

08:04.390 --> 08:05.390
you can use it too.

08:07.040 --> 08:08.530
You just came up with this

08:08.720 --> 08:09.950
while you were

08:11.000 --> 08:12.460
in the Penal Court prison?

08:13.000 --> 08:14.040
What do you think?

08:15.630 --> 08:16.560
You seek neither

08:16.830 --> 08:17.760
wealth nor fame.

08:18.550 --> 08:20.610
What you fear is losing your freedom.

08:21.040 --> 08:21.900
I am also afraid

08:22.480 --> 08:23.730
that a slight misstep in the future

08:23.730 --> 08:24.930
might implicate you.

08:25.890 --> 08:27.130
After much thought,

08:27.920 --> 08:29.380
this is the only solution.

08:30.970 --> 08:33.299
Your three-year mourning period is over.

08:34.200 --> 08:35.260
I wrote two copies.

08:36.220 --> 08:37.440
I plan to

08:37.909 --> 08:39.030
take one to Old Madam Ji

08:39.030 --> 08:40.230
in Tongzhou.

08:40.669 --> 08:41.270
That way,

08:42.440 --> 08:45.240
it will be easier for me
to formally propose to you.

08:45.270 --> 08:46.320
[Enlightenment]

08:49.960 --> 08:50.480
Okay.

08:57.640 --> 08:58.770
That would be good.

09:01.940 --> 09:04.150
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

09:04.810 --> 09:06.530
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

09:07.570 --> 09:11.230
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

09:10.880 --> 09:20.520
[Original Nature]

09:12.040 --> 09:14.370
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

09:15.510 --> 09:19.210
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

09:19.990 --> 09:22.160
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

09:23.100 --> 09:24.580
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

09:25.730 --> 09:30.390
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

09:31.540 --> 09:35.040
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

09:37.330 --> 09:39.090
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

09:38.550 --> 09:40.670
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

09:39.670 --> 09:40.390
Qingpu.

09:41.390 --> 09:42.360
What do you suppose

09:42.360 --> 09:44.040
he was thinking

09:44.440 --> 09:45.840
when he wrote this?

09:49.360 --> 09:50.550
I don't know.

09:51.300 --> 09:53.360
Grand Secretary is really something.

09:53.360 --> 09:54.760
He's different from

09:54.840 --> 09:56.240
ordinary people like us.

09:56.610 --> 09:58.680
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

10:02.320 --> 10:03.430
You don't seek

10:03.520 --> 10:04.440
wealth or fame.

10:05.320 --> 10:07.380
What you fear is losing your freedom.

10:07.750 --> 10:08.610
I am also afraid

10:09.360 --> 10:10.510
that a slight misstep in the future

10:10.510 --> 10:11.710
might implicate you.

10:11.870 --> 10:15.470
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

10:12.120 --> 10:13.480
If I ever run into danger

10:13.720 --> 10:15.320
at court in the future,

10:16.360 --> 10:16.840
you can

10:16.840 --> 10:18.150
take this,

10:18.630 --> 10:19.560
fill in the date,

10:20.510 --> 10:21.460
and leave without

10:21.460 --> 10:22.920
having to consult anyone.

10:23.550 --> 10:24.510
Or

10:25.510 --> 10:26.770
if you grow tired of me,

10:27.960 --> 10:28.960
you can use it too.

10:33.270 --> 10:35.020
May you, after this parting,

10:35.600 --> 10:36.930
have a bright future,

10:37.320 --> 10:38.850
radiant as the morning sun,

10:39.390 --> 10:41.050
with all things going your way

10:41.080 --> 10:42.480
and a life of ease and joy.

11:07.570 --> 11:08.320
What?

11:08.790 --> 11:10.060
You want me to pay?

11:10.510 --> 11:12.750
Our Gu family has suffered
a great disaster this time.

11:12.750 --> 11:13.550
All the men in the family

11:13.550 --> 11:15.200
were thrown into prison.

11:15.550 --> 11:17.440
This whole disaster

11:17.440 --> 11:18.550
was brought about by

11:18.550 --> 11:20.270
your dereliction of duty.

11:20.630 --> 11:22.080
It's only right that your branch

11:22.080 --> 11:23.480
bears the compensation.

11:23.510 --> 11:25.320
What do you mean I caused it?

11:26.400 --> 11:27.730
I was framed

11:28.150 --> 11:30.320
by Sun Shitao.

11:30.320 --> 11:32.200
I'm wronged too.

11:32.200 --> 11:34.000
You're wronged?

11:34.200 --> 11:35.840
You are the Director of the Treasury.

11:35.840 --> 11:37.510
12,000 tons of grain from

11:37.510 --> 11:39.320
the Daxin granary were switched out.

11:39.320 --> 11:40.790
They used your seal,

11:41.200 --> 11:42.600
and you didn't even know!

11:44.840 --> 11:46.640
You still claim you're wronged?

11:46.840 --> 11:49.170
Who do you think
is more wronged—you or me?

11:50.600 --> 11:51.600
I have worked hard

11:51.600 --> 11:53.510
in the Censorate for so many years,

11:53.510 --> 11:55.370
finally getting a chance to rise.

11:56.030 --> 11:57.590
If it weren't for you,

11:57.960 --> 11:59.760
I'd already have been promoted.

12:01.840 --> 12:02.480
And now

12:03.510 --> 12:05.840
who knows how long
I'll have to wait again.

12:06.000 --> 12:06.910
Exactly.

12:07.440 --> 12:09.510
He was thrown into prison for nothing.

12:09.510 --> 12:11.630
That's hardly a good reputation to have.

12:11.630 --> 12:12.290
He may never

12:12.510 --> 12:14.510
get another chance because of this.

12:18.720 --> 12:20.360
Will you stop

12:20.360 --> 12:21.750
jinxing it?

12:25.080 --> 12:25.630
Dezhao.

12:26.230 --> 12:27.690
Deyuan suffered this time

12:27.840 --> 12:29.400
purely because of you.

12:29.510 --> 12:31.240
He was just collateral damage.

12:31.580 --> 12:33.040
If you know what's proper,

12:33.080 --> 12:34.270
you should bring out some silver

12:34.270 --> 12:36.120
to compensate the second branch,

12:36.120 --> 12:37.000
and let this matter

12:37.000 --> 12:37.840
end here.

12:38.330 --> 12:40.280
I can't.

12:40.960 --> 12:41.960
I've already been

12:42.510 --> 12:44.490
exiled to some godforsaken place

12:44.750 --> 12:47.130
as a petty seventh-grade official.

12:47.720 --> 12:49.290
And you still want me

12:49.670 --> 12:51.600
to give money to them?

12:51.960 --> 12:53.620
You might as well ask me to die.

13:08.440 --> 13:09.000
My Lady.

13:11.510 --> 13:12.120
My Lady,

13:12.600 --> 13:13.800
you're finally back.

13:14.670 --> 13:15.490
My Lady.

13:15.720 --> 13:16.510
Your branch

13:16.510 --> 13:18.120
has made our whole family suffer so much.

13:18.120 --> 13:19.510
I just took a few of your things,

13:19.510 --> 13:21.060
and you're stopping me?

13:21.200 --> 13:22.530
And you dare to scold me?

13:23.600 --> 13:24.150
Someone!

13:24.150 --> 13:25.120
Take everything

13:25.120 --> 13:26.240
from those shelves!

13:26.240 --> 13:27.120
Yes, My Lady.

13:27.210 --> 13:27.980
Get up.

13:28.910 --> 13:29.970
You, go over there.

13:30.200 --> 13:31.080
No.

13:31.790 --> 13:32.780
No!

13:33.080 --> 13:33.940
Don't touch it!

13:34.600 --> 13:35.510
Don't!

13:36.510 --> 13:38.240
-You can't take this!
-My Lady.

13:38.750 --> 13:39.880
You can't take this!

13:40.600 --> 13:42.120
My mother gave this to me!

13:44.000 --> 13:45.100
Give it

13:45.360 --> 13:46.150
back to me!

13:56.540 --> 13:58.200
I'll beat you to death!

13:58.840 --> 13:59.910
Are you crazy?

14:00.460 --> 14:01.700
Yes, I am crazy.

14:02.840 --> 14:04.190
What are you doing?

14:05.750 --> 14:06.510
Mother!

14:06.510 --> 14:07.200
My Lady.

14:07.670 --> 14:08.840
You wretch!

14:09.240 --> 14:11.750
Mother, she scratched my face

14:11.750 --> 14:13.640
and tried to strangle me!

14:14.030 --> 14:15.600
You little wrech!

14:15.600 --> 14:17.000
Being raised by a concubine

14:17.000 --> 14:18.550
has made you utterly vicious.

14:18.550 --> 14:19.810
You're truly malicious.

14:19.810 --> 14:20.720
Someone!

14:20.720 --> 14:21.510
Seize her!

14:21.810 --> 14:22.360
Yes.

14:22.360 --> 14:23.320
Mother.

14:23.320 --> 14:25.030
She was trying to kill me!

14:25.030 --> 14:25.670
My Lady.

14:26.600 --> 14:27.930
Let go of my lady!

14:28.080 --> 14:29.270
-Don't hit her.
-I'll teach you!

14:29.270 --> 14:30.200
Don't you dare hit her!

14:30.200 --> 14:31.830
-Stop!
-You wrech!

14:32.720 --> 14:33.910
You think you're tough, huh?

14:33.910 --> 14:34.630
Stop!

14:36.630 --> 14:37.230
Let her go!

14:37.510 --> 14:38.440
Don't let her go.

14:39.510 --> 14:40.670
She hit Lian.

14:41.030 --> 14:41.910
She can't go.

14:42.030 --> 14:42.660
Qingpu!

14:42.790 --> 14:43.390
Yes!

14:50.730 --> 14:51.930
Zhao.

14:52.750 --> 14:54.150
Lian wanted to take my things.

14:54.150 --> 14:54.870
I refused,

14:55.070 --> 14:56.270
so she snatched them.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.800
What do you mean "snatched"?

14:57.800 --> 14:58.960
You're the ones

14:58.960 --> 14:59.750
who owe us.

15:00.870 --> 15:01.670
Owe you?

15:03.080 --> 15:03.870
Second Aunt,

15:04.360 --> 15:05.510
what does that mean?

15:06.150 --> 15:08.080
This disaster in the household

15:08.320 --> 15:10.200
was all caused by you.

15:10.200 --> 15:11.630
Our second and fifth branches

15:11.630 --> 15:13.290
were just collateral damage.

15:13.520 --> 15:15.490
You should compensate us.

15:15.720 --> 15:16.450
Compensate?

15:16.870 --> 15:18.800
Old Madam has already agreed to it.

15:20.150 --> 15:21.030
In that case,

15:21.130 --> 15:22.420
we might as well talk it out

15:22.420 --> 15:23.870
in front of Grandmother.

15:32.720 --> 15:33.670
Does it hurt?

15:33.960 --> 15:34.960
Can you still go?

15:36.240 --> 15:36.790
I can.

15:37.420 --> 15:38.700
I will go with you.

15:39.390 --> 15:40.790
They've gone too far.

15:42.510 --> 15:43.040
Let's go.

15:46.960 --> 15:48.290
What are you looking at?

15:53.510 --> 15:54.600
Since Zhao wants

15:55.030 --> 15:56.900
to lay everything out at once,

15:58.030 --> 15:59.000
then let's do it.

15:59.670 --> 16:00.850
Dexiu is on duty.

16:01.320 --> 16:02.600
Rong and Xian

16:02.600 --> 16:03.660
are at the academy.

16:03.910 --> 16:05.970
There's no need for them to come back.

16:06.030 --> 16:07.430
Even though the Gu family

16:07.670 --> 16:09.930
has been struck by this unjust disaster,

16:11.200 --> 16:12.720
it ultimately comes down to

16:12.720 --> 16:13.980
Dezhao's dereliction

16:14.120 --> 16:15.150
of duty.

16:16.270 --> 16:17.840
You can't say that.

16:18.170 --> 16:18.960
Dezhao.

16:20.170 --> 16:22.480
Let Mother finish speaking first.

16:25.080 --> 16:27.140
We've already reached an agreement.

16:27.270 --> 16:28.840
This time, the fourth branch

16:28.840 --> 16:31.170
must compensate 100,000 taels of silver.

16:31.790 --> 16:32.360
Zhao.

16:32.910 --> 16:34.370
Although you are a junior,

16:34.600 --> 16:37.200
everyone knows you in charge
of the fourth branch.

16:37.200 --> 16:38.550
What's your view on this?

16:38.550 --> 16:39.950
100,000 taels of silver?

16:41.840 --> 16:43.390
Our entire household's annual income

16:43.390 --> 16:44.850
is just over 20,000 taels.

16:45.480 --> 16:47.840
And you're asking
for 100,000 just like that?

16:47.840 --> 16:50.760
Do you really think I have mountains
of gold and silver?

16:50.760 --> 16:52.240
You can't say that.

16:52.650 --> 16:54.560
We suffered a huge loss this time.

16:55.200 --> 16:56.200
Your Second Uncle

16:56.200 --> 16:56.750
was originally about to

16:56.750 --> 16:58.750
become Vice Minister of Personnel.

17:00.030 --> 17:03.630
Second Uncle won't be able to
become Vice Minister of Personnel.

17:04.589 --> 17:05.240
Why?

17:06.040 --> 17:07.800
Because Lord Yao Ping

17:07.819 --> 17:08.950
also wants the post.

17:09.609 --> 17:11.349
He has followed
the Senior Grand Secretary for many years

17:11.349 --> 17:12.609
and ranks ahead of you.

17:12.829 --> 17:13.349
What...

17:14.170 --> 17:15.690
what do you know

17:15.790 --> 17:17.050
about court politics?

17:18.140 --> 17:19.069
I at least

17:19.069 --> 17:20.400
had a chance.

17:22.680 --> 17:25.010
But because of the trouble Dezhao caused,

17:25.240 --> 17:27.310
it's all gone now.

17:27.510 --> 17:27.970
What...

17:28.310 --> 17:30.070
what do you mean I caused the trouble?

17:30.070 --> 17:32.870
I'm also the victim
of that unwarranted disaster.

17:38.350 --> 17:39.510
Do you all think

17:39.680 --> 17:41.660
this case of relief grain

17:41.960 --> 17:42.830
being replaced with bran was caused

17:42.830 --> 17:43.640
by our master?

17:45.830 --> 17:46.970
If so,

17:47.240 --> 17:48.240
then our Gu family

17:48.630 --> 17:50.430
will be in for another disaster.

17:51.510 --> 17:52.590
What do you mean?

17:53.480 --> 17:54.070
True.

17:54.270 --> 17:56.440
Master is guilty of dereliction of duty.

17:56.440 --> 17:58.590
But he has already
been convicted by the court

17:58.590 --> 18:00.070
and demoted to
a seventh-grade county magistrate.

18:00.070 --> 18:01.670
The case has been concluded,

18:01.710 --> 18:03.180
and the court has already dropped it.

18:03.180 --> 18:04.360
Now that he's home,

18:04.390 --> 18:06.190
why hold him accountable again?

18:07.310 --> 18:09.160
Are you suggesting that

18:09.280 --> 18:11.690
His Majesty and the court were unjust,

18:12.070 --> 18:13.180
and that you wish to set up your own court

18:13.180 --> 18:14.350
and retry the case?

18:15.310 --> 18:16.550
You... you're just

18:16.550 --> 18:18.000
being unreasonable.

18:19.350 --> 18:21.070
If you insist on taking this money,

18:21.070 --> 18:22.550
then I'll go straight
to the Shuntian Prefecture

18:22.550 --> 18:24.550
and have the magistrate pass judgment.

18:24.550 --> 18:26.200
I've been there twice anyway.

18:26.200 --> 18:27.000
I'm not afraid

18:27.090 --> 18:28.290
to go there once more.

18:28.480 --> 18:29.030
Right.

18:32.180 --> 18:33.060
Gu Jinzhao.

18:33.240 --> 18:34.570
Don't be unreasonable.

18:35.510 --> 18:36.540
The court

18:37.000 --> 18:38.550
has treated this as a state matter.

18:38.550 --> 18:39.480
But here and now,

18:39.920 --> 18:41.120
it is a family matter.

18:41.750 --> 18:42.780
Since it's a family matter,

18:42.780 --> 18:44.550
it should be be settled by family rules.

18:44.550 --> 18:46.000
Don't bring up criminal charges here.

18:46.000 --> 18:46.400
So

18:46.920 --> 18:48.240
you mean

18:48.510 --> 18:50.110
you won't pay a single penny?

18:51.880 --> 18:52.680
Not exactly.

18:54.640 --> 18:56.470
Our master is not entirely

18:56.500 --> 18:58.160
without fault in this matter.

18:58.620 --> 19:00.130
I will have someone check

19:00.160 --> 19:02.480
the losses of each branch
in their shops and estates,

19:02.480 --> 19:03.790
calculate a reasonable amount

19:03.790 --> 19:05.240
and provide compensation accordingly.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.770
I will hand it all over to you

19:07.070 --> 19:08.130
for distribution.

19:08.960 --> 19:09.850
Do any of you

19:10.000 --> 19:11.200
have any objections?

19:17.050 --> 19:18.850
Zhao's proposal is reasonable.

19:19.070 --> 19:20.730
Our branch has no objections.

19:20.920 --> 19:22.380
Hui should be awake by now.

19:22.790 --> 19:23.310
Mother.

19:23.830 --> 19:24.870
If there's nothing else,

19:24.870 --> 19:26.150
I'll take my leave.

19:30.280 --> 19:31.480
You should all go now.

19:32.350 --> 19:34.000
I should get some rest as well.

19:34.000 --> 19:34.770
Wait.

19:39.720 --> 19:41.720
Lian tried to take Lan's belongings

19:41.770 --> 19:43.200
and even smashed her

19:43.200 --> 19:44.550
jade-and-gold necklace.

19:44.550 --> 19:46.380
Shouldn't Lian compensate for that too?

19:46.380 --> 19:47.640
There was such a thing?

19:48.440 --> 19:50.240
H... how much do you want?

19:50.960 --> 19:52.200
That necklace

19:52.200 --> 19:53.480
was recorded in the register.

19:53.480 --> 19:55.210
It is worth 500 taels of silver.

19:57.790 --> 19:58.880
500 taels?

20:00.750 --> 20:01.880
I'm not paying that!

20:02.350 --> 20:03.790
If you don't want to pay, that's fine.

20:03.790 --> 20:04.400
Later,

20:04.830 --> 20:05.440
We can simply

20:05.440 --> 20:06.720
deduct it from the silver

20:06.720 --> 20:08.000
allocated to your branch.

20:08.000 --> 20:08.590
You...

20:13.960 --> 20:14.510
Zhao.

20:15.640 --> 20:16.960
Then can I...

20:24.110 --> 20:25.390
Thank you, Zhao,

20:25.550 --> 20:27.210
for upholding justice for me.

20:27.510 --> 20:29.160
I was just about to say something to you.

20:29.160 --> 20:31.000
While I've been away,

20:31.710 --> 20:33.170
I heard you spent money

20:33.440 --> 20:34.510
to make sure

20:34.510 --> 20:36.310
Rong was looked after in prison.

20:36.960 --> 20:39.070
I'm now planning
to renovate Linxia Restaurant

20:39.070 --> 20:39.880
and reopen it

20:39.880 --> 20:40.710
as a new shop.

20:41.270 --> 20:42.590
I want to expand the shares.

20:42.590 --> 20:43.680
If you are willing,

20:43.680 --> 20:45.210
you can take a stake as well.

20:45.550 --> 20:46.370
But

20:46.510 --> 20:47.750
you have to think it through.

20:47.750 --> 20:48.730
Business always

20:48.920 --> 20:50.350
comes with both profit and loss.

20:50.350 --> 20:51.110
I'm willing.

20:52.770 --> 20:53.700
Thank you, Zhao.

20:55.200 --> 20:55.820
Mother.

20:55.960 --> 20:56.550
This...

20:57.080 --> 20:57.980
Zhao.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.980
Do you still have any shares

21:01.920 --> 21:03.720
left in your Linxia Restaurant?

21:04.880 --> 21:05.550
Right.

21:05.550 --> 21:07.000
We are all family.

21:07.110 --> 21:07.920
If there's profit to be made,

21:07.920 --> 21:09.520
we should share it together.

21:10.690 --> 21:12.290
Share the profits together?

21:13.350 --> 21:15.400
You really have the nerve to say that.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.440
Lan, let's go.

21:35.230 --> 21:36.340
I'm exhausted.

21:37.550 --> 21:38.920
Saying all these things

21:39.000 --> 21:40.510
gave me a headache.

21:44.270 --> 21:45.750
My Lady, you are too kind.

21:46.200 --> 21:48.920
You even gave them
the properties as compensation.

21:48.920 --> 21:49.830
Honestly,

21:49.900 --> 21:51.240
even if you didn't pay a single penny,

21:51.240 --> 21:52.300
what could they do?

21:53.110 --> 21:54.910
They couldn't do anything to me,

21:55.420 --> 21:57.220
but they could annoy me to death.

22:00.510 --> 22:01.430
Besides,

22:01.590 --> 22:03.390
our branch

22:03.550 --> 22:05.160
is not entirely
without fault in this matter.

22:05.160 --> 22:06.290
Let's just pay them.

22:08.200 --> 22:10.260
Moreover, whether they can even keep

22:10.550 --> 22:11.680
this small amount of silver

22:11.680 --> 22:13.210
is still another question.

22:13.440 --> 22:14.310
Why?

22:15.070 --> 22:16.060
Think about it.

22:16.200 --> 22:17.530
If I marry Third Master,

22:18.000 --> 22:18.860
would they dare

22:19.070 --> 22:20.110
reduce my dowry?

22:20.670 --> 22:21.800
They wouldn't dare!

22:22.790 --> 22:23.590
Exactly.

22:29.640 --> 22:30.550
This Zhao

22:30.570 --> 22:31.970
is really unreasonable.

22:32.720 --> 22:35.250
Lan is just a concubine-born sister.

22:35.470 --> 22:37.450
Why did Zhao give her shares?

22:37.470 --> 22:38.930
She should give them to me.

22:39.010 --> 22:41.080
I am her legitimate cousin.

22:41.680 --> 22:42.240
Besides,

22:42.920 --> 22:45.050
I am going to marry into the Yao family.

22:45.070 --> 22:46.040
Pleasing me

22:46.200 --> 22:48.460
is much more useful than pleasing Gu Lan.

22:50.640 --> 22:52.110
I'm talking to you.

22:52.110 --> 22:53.330
Don't you think so?

22:53.960 --> 22:54.960
Yes, My Lady.

22:57.070 --> 22:58.310
You are not clever at all.

22:58.310 --> 23:00.110
-Why are you so stupid?
-My Lady.

23:00.400 --> 23:02.060
You're not even close to Tang.

23:02.350 --> 23:03.000
My Lady.

23:03.000 --> 23:04.070
It hurts.

23:07.640 --> 23:09.140
Isn't this Ziling?

23:10.350 --> 23:10.960
Come here.

23:17.200 --> 23:17.750
Well,

23:18.110 --> 23:19.170
do you understand?

23:19.510 --> 23:20.300
My Lady,

23:20.680 --> 23:21.670
that won't do.

23:21.960 --> 23:23.230
Why not?

23:24.790 --> 23:26.070
If you don't do that,

23:26.590 --> 23:27.590
I'll have you sold off

23:27.590 --> 23:29.320
first thing tomorrow morning.

23:29.590 --> 23:30.590
Believe it or not.

23:35.070 --> 23:36.000
It hurts.

23:37.510 --> 23:38.350
Ziling.

23:38.720 --> 23:40.180
C... come here.

23:40.550 --> 23:41.440
Xiuju?

23:42.880 --> 23:44.210
What are you doing here?

23:45.910 --> 23:47.120
I sprained my ankle.

23:47.270 --> 23:48.670
Can you help me up?

23:51.550 --> 23:52.240
Let me see.

23:52.240 --> 23:53.350
It hurts.

23:53.640 --> 23:54.350
Is it here?

23:54.350 --> 23:55.300
Over here.

23:55.550 --> 23:56.440
Here.

23:56.640 --> 23:57.590
It hurts so much.

24:02.200 --> 24:03.030
Let's go.

24:03.030 --> 24:03.790
Let's go.

24:07.480 --> 24:09.310
Luckily they dug out
the pond mud a few days ago,

24:09.310 --> 24:10.710
so the water wasn't deep.

24:11.510 --> 24:12.670
This Gu Lian

24:13.160 --> 24:14.510
is truly going too far.

24:15.120 --> 24:15.880
Oh, right.

24:22.770 --> 24:24.570
Good thing it didn't get soaked.

24:25.270 --> 24:26.660
I went to three silversmith shops

24:26.660 --> 24:27.790
before finally finding one

24:27.790 --> 24:29.640
that could repair that necklace.

24:29.640 --> 24:31.230
This is the deposit receipt.

24:31.230 --> 24:33.090
I'll keep it safe for you, My Lady.

24:35.240 --> 24:36.450
You're still worrying about

24:36.450 --> 24:38.380
the deposit when you're like this?

24:38.480 --> 24:39.110
All I can think about

24:39.110 --> 24:40.720
is how to get revenge on her.

24:44.880 --> 24:45.960
Yao Wenxiu

24:46.240 --> 24:48.160
has sent another letter, hasn't he?

24:48.160 --> 24:48.920
Yes.

24:51.110 --> 24:51.920
Bring it to me.

24:59.240 --> 25:01.570
He actually wants me to go admire flowers?

25:01.830 --> 25:03.350
He really has no shame.

25:05.200 --> 25:05.960
Bring me

25:05.980 --> 25:07.580
my writing materials later.

25:08.590 --> 25:11.110
My Lady, are you going
to meet Young Master Yao?

25:11.110 --> 25:11.550
Yes.

25:13.200 --> 25:14.000
But

25:14.510 --> 25:15.200
Young Master Yao

25:15.200 --> 25:17.240
is Miss Lian's future husband.

25:17.400 --> 25:19.060
That's exactly why I'm going.

25:22.510 --> 25:23.030
Well...

25:23.350 --> 25:24.550
I'll go get them then.

25:31.010 --> 25:33.650
[Baiwei Restaurant]

25:35.680 --> 25:36.920
What's the rush?

25:38.440 --> 25:39.570
Have a drink with me?

25:40.400 --> 25:41.000
Wine?

25:41.350 --> 25:43.150
I prepared it specially for you.

25:43.270 --> 25:45.360
I heard you like Zhaoyebai.

25:47.310 --> 25:48.000
Alright.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.240
You prepared it for me,

25:49.240 --> 25:51.040
yet you started drinking first.

25:58.510 --> 25:59.030
Come on.

26:06.200 --> 26:06.920
Not bad.

26:10.350 --> 26:12.280
You've been to the file storeroom?

26:12.880 --> 26:14.410
It was quite an eye-opener.

26:15.070 --> 26:16.270
Did you read the ones

26:16.830 --> 26:17.760
bearing my name?

26:18.110 --> 26:18.750
Yes.

26:19.510 --> 26:20.270
The file storeroom

26:20.270 --> 26:22.240
contains 167 iron chests

26:22.240 --> 26:23.700
of surveillance records.

26:23.790 --> 26:25.350
Among all the court's
senior officials,

26:25.350 --> 26:26.590
some have one or two chests,

26:26.590 --> 26:28.120
some have more than a dozen.

26:28.720 --> 26:29.980
But there is one person

26:30.070 --> 26:31.130
who has none at all.

26:32.550 --> 26:33.400
Fu Hailian.

26:34.000 --> 26:35.150
If I'm not mistaken,

26:35.590 --> 26:37.790
after His Majesty ascended the throne,

26:37.820 --> 26:39.640
he ordered Zhang Ling
to secretly destroy them.

26:39.640 --> 26:41.000
Have you interrogated Zhang Ling?

26:41.000 --> 26:42.730
Every form of torture was used,

26:43.270 --> 26:45.730
but he refused to confess
even a single word.

26:47.790 --> 26:48.720
I want the leverage

26:48.720 --> 26:50.120
you hold over Fu Hailian.

26:50.480 --> 26:51.640
Since you have information about

26:51.640 --> 26:52.310
Zhao Jichang

26:52.310 --> 26:54.270
bribing court officials
from more than ten years ago,

26:54.270 --> 26:55.640
you must also have something on him.

26:55.640 --> 26:56.240
I don't have any.

26:56.240 --> 26:57.040
You're lying.

26:57.900 --> 26:59.160
I really don't have it.

26:59.790 --> 27:00.730
Even if I did,

27:00.900 --> 27:02.500
it wouldn't prove anything.

27:03.030 --> 27:03.890
Think about it.

27:04.240 --> 27:05.030
If I had known

27:05.030 --> 27:06.790
about his crimes,

27:07.200 --> 27:07.830
why would I have

27:07.830 --> 27:09.290
followed him until today?

27:11.200 --> 27:12.590
So you regret it now?

27:13.240 --> 27:13.970
Not exactly.

27:14.520 --> 27:15.550
Anyone in his position

27:15.550 --> 27:16.920
may not necessarily

27:18.310 --> 27:19.680
have done better.

27:21.160 --> 27:22.030
I know you hate him

27:22.030 --> 27:24.490
for framing the Marquis
and the Marquisate,

27:24.590 --> 27:26.440
so you want to find leverage

27:26.440 --> 27:27.440
to bring him down.

27:27.550 --> 27:28.810
But now is not the time.

27:29.640 --> 27:30.640
Fan Chuan is dead.

27:31.030 --> 27:32.270
Mentor holds immense power.

27:32.270 --> 27:34.310
From the Emperor down to the ministers,

27:34.310 --> 27:35.070
no one dares

27:35.070 --> 27:36.440
speak against him.

27:37.640 --> 27:39.040
If you go against him now,

27:39.590 --> 27:40.720
you stand no chance.

27:43.750 --> 27:44.950
You are afraid of him?

27:48.350 --> 27:49.000
I am.

27:51.310 --> 27:52.000
So,

27:53.270 --> 27:54.070
I advise you

27:54.510 --> 27:55.920
not to act rashly.

28:02.170 --> 28:04.650
[Generations of Excellence]

28:05.440 --> 28:06.710
Give this contract

28:06.830 --> 28:07.980
and the account book

28:08.110 --> 28:09.040
to Grandmother.

28:10.070 --> 28:11.240
The distribution of silver for the second

28:11.240 --> 28:12.300
and fifth branches

28:12.350 --> 28:13.950
has all been recorded there.

28:16.270 --> 28:17.030
Yes.

28:18.750 --> 28:19.750
Honestly,

28:20.720 --> 28:22.830
you are the most wronged in all this.

28:23.400 --> 28:25.130
It was clearly Master's fault,

28:25.440 --> 28:27.070
but you have to bear it all.

28:27.830 --> 28:29.730
Then what else could I do?

28:29.960 --> 28:31.420
With such a huge incident,

28:31.440 --> 28:32.970
if I didn't take responsibility for it,

28:32.970 --> 28:34.400
the entire family,

28:34.400 --> 28:35.540
including myself,

28:35.720 --> 28:36.850
would be in trouble.

28:38.550 --> 28:40.080
Although this incident

28:40.550 --> 28:42.950
is ultimately the Imperial Court's fault,

28:43.240 --> 28:44.510
if our Master

28:44.510 --> 28:46.510
had not been so negligent in his duties,

28:46.510 --> 28:48.510
others would not have targeted him,

28:49.640 --> 28:50.730
and things

28:51.000 --> 28:52.530
might not have come to this.

29:00.190 --> 29:02.570
[Land Survey Register]

29:02.920 --> 29:04.550
Zhao is quite impressive.

29:05.160 --> 29:06.880
She's more reasonable than her father.

29:06.880 --> 29:08.110
Exactly.

29:08.440 --> 29:10.240
If she'd kept being unreasonable,

29:10.240 --> 29:12.700
we couldn't have forced
the money out of her.

29:15.590 --> 29:16.590
Mother.

29:17.310 --> 29:18.720
One of these shops

29:18.740 --> 29:20.570
is in Dazhanmao Alley, and the other

29:20.570 --> 29:21.890
is near Xiaodongmen.

29:23.160 --> 29:25.110
How about our branch

29:25.110 --> 29:26.920
takeing the one in Xiaodongmen?

29:27.920 --> 29:29.350
I happen to have a dowry property

29:29.350 --> 29:30.290
there,

29:30.550 --> 29:32.750
so it will be more convenient to manage.

29:32.960 --> 29:34.490
I was just about to say that.

29:37.270 --> 29:38.870
The property in Xiaodongmen

29:39.200 --> 29:41.930
is more valuable than
the one in Dazhanmao Alley.

29:42.640 --> 29:44.100
If I give it to your branch,

29:44.720 --> 29:46.880
the fifth branch definitely won't agree.

29:46.880 --> 29:47.920
If it were the other way around,

29:47.920 --> 29:48.850
would you agree?

29:51.160 --> 29:52.560
I've thought it through.

29:53.510 --> 29:55.500
Let's keep it in the common fund for now,

29:55.500 --> 29:58.030
and when there's a surplus
at the end of the year,

29:58.030 --> 29:59.430
we'll divide it equally.

30:00.550 --> 30:01.750
Alright, put it away.

30:04.790 --> 30:06.270
Yes, Mother.

30:19.070 --> 30:20.680
This is

30:20.680 --> 30:21.680
stinginess

30:21.880 --> 30:23.080
taken to the extreme.

30:25.000 --> 30:26.070
This was clearly compensation

30:26.070 --> 30:27.400
from Zhao to our branch.

30:27.480 --> 30:29.340
On what grounds is she keeping it?

30:30.350 --> 30:32.210
She talks nicely about letting me

30:32.240 --> 30:33.500
manage the household,

30:33.920 --> 30:36.220
but she won't let go of any control.

30:37.000 --> 30:37.960
And your father

30:37.960 --> 30:39.960
always does whatever she says.

30:41.550 --> 30:43.350
It's driving me crazy.

30:45.550 --> 30:46.310
Mother.

30:49.080 --> 30:50.350
Right now,

30:50.700 --> 30:51.590
all I hope for is that

30:51.590 --> 30:53.650
you'll marry into the Yao family soon

30:54.240 --> 30:56.400
and become the daughter-in-law
of a third-rank official.

30:56.400 --> 30:57.760
Then I can finally

30:57.880 --> 31:00.080
enjoy some prestige

31:00.270 --> 31:01.470
and hold my head high.

31:02.750 --> 31:03.990
Don't worry, Mother.

31:04.240 --> 31:05.750
After I get married,

31:05.750 --> 31:07.440
I'll come see you often

31:07.440 --> 31:09.350
and back you up.

31:09.790 --> 31:10.920
In your dreams.

31:11.490 --> 31:12.790
What family lets a new bride

31:12.790 --> 31:13.680
go back to her mother's home

31:13.680 --> 31:14.810
every other day?

31:15.110 --> 31:16.780
Wenxiu dotes on me so much.

31:16.810 --> 31:17.720
He even said

31:17.720 --> 31:18.400
he'll do

31:18.400 --> 31:19.860
whatever I say from now on.

31:21.310 --> 31:22.550
Silly girl.

31:23.750 --> 31:24.280
Let's go.

31:26.000 --> 31:26.870
My Lady,

31:27.000 --> 31:28.030
how about we...

31:28.920 --> 31:30.310
Don't try to stop me anymore.

31:30.310 --> 31:31.640
Lian has gone too far.

31:31.720 --> 31:33.200
If I don't teach her a lesson,

31:33.200 --> 31:34.510
she'll drive me crazy.

31:38.000 --> 31:38.510
My Lady.

31:41.310 --> 31:42.160
Lan.

31:43.480 --> 31:44.940
I had planned to come early

31:45.070 --> 31:46.000
and wait for you,

31:46.240 --> 31:47.070
but I didn't expect

31:47.070 --> 31:48.110
to still be late.

31:49.480 --> 31:50.480
Young Master Yao.

31:51.030 --> 31:52.290
I told you.

31:52.350 --> 31:53.410
Don't call me that.

31:55.480 --> 31:56.510
Wenxiu.

31:58.720 --> 31:59.790
Your dress today

31:59.790 --> 32:00.750
is so beautiful.

32:02.960 --> 32:04.960
I didn't expect you to reply so quickly.

32:04.960 --> 32:06.720
I thought it would be like before—

32:06.720 --> 32:07.640
no reply at all.

32:09.920 --> 32:10.750
Actually,

32:10.750 --> 32:12.200
I hadn't intended to come today.

32:12.200 --> 32:12.920
Why?

32:13.450 --> 32:14.110
Why play dumb

32:14.110 --> 32:15.970
when you know exactly what I mean?

32:16.160 --> 32:17.890
You are Lian's future husband,

32:17.920 --> 32:19.410
yet you keep writing to me

32:19.640 --> 32:21.570
and inviting me to admire flowers.

32:21.920 --> 32:23.650
But you still came, didn't you?

32:25.750 --> 32:26.480
Don't worry,

32:26.880 --> 32:27.880
I don't like Lian.

32:31.280 --> 32:32.480
Don't talk nonsense.

32:32.680 --> 32:33.680
I mean it.

32:35.070 --> 32:36.110
So what?

32:36.440 --> 32:37.970
You still have to marry her.

32:41.970 --> 32:43.730
Are you jealous?

32:48.350 --> 32:49.880
You smell so lovely—

32:50.680 --> 32:52.480
far sweeter than these flowers.

32:53.680 --> 32:55.110
You... don't be like this.

32:55.110 --> 32:55.930
Alright.

32:56.160 --> 32:57.440
I won't tease you anymore.

32:57.440 --> 32:58.070
Dear Lan.

32:58.790 --> 32:59.850
Since you are here,

32:59.880 --> 33:02.080
it means you still have me in your heart.

33:02.110 --> 33:03.440
I'll tell you the truth.

33:04.030 --> 33:05.490
I plan to end my engagement

33:06.380 --> 33:07.060
with Lian.

33:08.000 --> 33:08.590
What?

33:09.010 --> 33:11.340
You are going to break off the engagement?

33:11.440 --> 33:13.200
In a couple of days,
my mother will go to your family

33:13.200 --> 33:15.260
to discuss it with your grandmother.

33:16.140 --> 33:16.860
Why?

33:17.240 --> 33:18.750
I never wanted to
marry her in the first place.

33:18.750 --> 33:19.880
She always throws tantrums.

33:19.880 --> 33:21.400
I really can't be bothered.

33:21.400 --> 33:23.000
I've brought it up
at home several times already.

33:23.000 --> 33:24.860
My parents couldn't persuade me,

33:25.160 --> 33:26.490
so they finally agreed.

33:29.920 --> 33:31.110
That way,

33:31.510 --> 33:33.160
we can...

33:37.110 --> 33:38.400
I still have a zither

33:38.400 --> 33:39.890
to pick up at Siming Hall.

33:39.960 --> 33:41.110
I need to go get it now.

33:41.110 --> 33:42.110
Please excuse me.

33:42.200 --> 33:43.670
Ziling, let's go.

33:45.510 --> 33:46.240
Lan!

33:49.590 --> 33:51.850
My Lady, why are you leaving so suddenly?

33:51.960 --> 33:53.000
The Yao family

33:53.000 --> 33:54.220
is going to break off
the engagement with Lian.

33:54.220 --> 33:55.950
What's the point of me staying?

33:57.450 --> 33:59.110
Yao Wenxiu that lying bastard

33:59.110 --> 34:00.270
is full of nonsense.

34:00.510 --> 34:01.960
He said he disliked Lian,

34:01.960 --> 34:03.720
so the Yao family agreed
to call off the engagement.

34:03.720 --> 34:05.240
But the real reason is that

34:05.240 --> 34:06.180
my Second Uncle

34:06.240 --> 34:07.310
was imprisoned once

34:07.310 --> 34:08.909
and his career is ruined now.

34:09.620 --> 34:11.670
Second Uncle is still
a fourth-grade official at least,

34:11.670 --> 34:13.360
and they already look down on him.

34:13.360 --> 34:14.830
Now that my father has even lost his post,

34:14.830 --> 34:16.690
do they still think they'd accept me?

34:16.690 --> 34:19.030
And yet he still had the nerve
to flirt with me.

34:19.030 --> 34:20.690
You really see through it all.

34:21.630 --> 34:23.760
Should we tell Miss Lian

34:23.960 --> 34:25.780
about the Yao family
calling off the engagement?

34:25.780 --> 34:27.110
Of course not.

34:27.480 --> 34:28.550
Don't tell anyone about it.

34:28.550 --> 34:30.150
Just wait and watch the show.

34:32.429 --> 34:34.670
[Chen Mansion]

34:33.400 --> 34:34.330
What did you say?

34:35.570 --> 34:37.150
You want to marry Zhao?

34:37.670 --> 34:38.190
Yes.

34:39.000 --> 34:40.280
W... why have you

34:40.280 --> 34:42.010
suddenly decided to marry her?

34:44.230 --> 34:45.560
Does the Gu family know?

34:46.400 --> 34:47.590
What about the Ji family?

34:47.590 --> 34:49.650
I have already informed Old Madam Ji,

34:49.920 --> 34:51.230
and she has agreed.

34:51.760 --> 34:52.449
Wait.

34:53.480 --> 34:54.880
You went to Tongzhou yesterday

34:54.880 --> 34:56.030
just for this?

34:59.710 --> 35:00.870
What about Zhao?

35:01.480 --> 35:02.280
Does she know?

35:02.590 --> 35:03.150
Yes.

35:03.840 --> 35:05.170
And she has also agreed.

35:05.550 --> 35:06.280
Right now,

35:06.590 --> 35:08.480
I just need your approval, Mother,

35:08.480 --> 35:09.840
and I can go and propose.

35:10.840 --> 35:12.070
So,

35:12.670 --> 35:15.100
I'm the only one you kept in the dark?

35:15.590 --> 35:17.440
I didn't mean to keep it from you, Mother.

35:17.440 --> 35:19.510
Of course you didn't!

35:19.880 --> 35:20.920
You just didn't want

35:20.920 --> 35:23.160
me to know too much.

35:24.030 --> 35:26.630
You've been like this
since you were little.

35:27.670 --> 35:28.710
People outside

35:28.710 --> 35:30.920
only think it's glorious that
I gave birth to a son

35:30.920 --> 35:32.580
who became a Grand Secretary.

35:33.670 --> 35:34.880
But in fact,

35:35.590 --> 35:37.360
you're not close

35:37.360 --> 35:38.800
to me at all.

35:39.550 --> 35:40.070
Mother,

35:40.360 --> 35:41.320
just listen to me first.

35:41.320 --> 35:43.150
You listen to me first!

35:45.110 --> 35:46.670
I really don't understand.

35:46.960 --> 35:49.230
Why do you want to marry Zhao?

35:50.030 --> 35:51.250
Zhao... she...

35:52.000 --> 35:53.610
We all know exactly

35:53.960 --> 35:55.420
what the Gu family is like.

35:56.550 --> 35:58.190
Zhao's reputation

35:58.190 --> 35:59.510
isn't good either.

36:00.670 --> 36:02.280
She's too headstrong.

36:02.710 --> 36:03.920
Anyone can tell

36:04.440 --> 36:05.710
that she is not someone

36:05.710 --> 36:08.420
who will take care of the family properly.

36:08.800 --> 36:09.590
She would

36:09.960 --> 36:10.920
bring no benefit

36:11.280 --> 36:12.590
to you or the Chen family.

36:12.590 --> 36:13.760
What I like about her

36:13.760 --> 36:15.230
is that she brings me no benefit.

36:15.230 --> 36:16.160
What do you mean?

36:19.320 --> 36:20.110
You all think

36:20.480 --> 36:22.000
I am the Senior Grand Secretary's

36:22.000 --> 36:22.840
favorite student,

36:22.840 --> 36:24.590
thriving in the court

36:24.670 --> 36:26.130
and at the height of power.

36:26.550 --> 36:28.000
But have you ever considered—

36:28.000 --> 36:28.840
what if one day

36:29.800 --> 36:31.330
my mentor falls from power?

36:32.440 --> 36:33.320
How could that be?

36:33.320 --> 36:34.380
Of course it could.

36:36.710 --> 36:38.170
No flower blooms forever.

36:38.510 --> 36:40.440
Mentor is now immensely powerful,

36:40.440 --> 36:42.510
with not a single voice
of opposition in court.

36:42.510 --> 36:44.550
But precisely because of that,
he is in greater danger.

36:44.550 --> 36:45.630
Leaving everything else aside,

36:45.630 --> 36:46.510
His Majesty,

36:46.840 --> 36:47.840
is growing older.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.360
Sooner or later,
he will take full control of governance.

36:49.360 --> 36:50.800
When His Majesty's authority
is fully consolidated,

36:50.800 --> 36:51.360
think carefully—

36:51.360 --> 36:52.890
who will he deal with first?

36:54.000 --> 36:55.400
If that day really comes—

36:55.920 --> 36:57.510
when the tree falls
and the monkeys scatter—

36:57.510 --> 36:59.070
what will happen

36:59.920 --> 37:01.050
to all his followers

37:01.320 --> 37:02.450
and even his family?

37:03.230 --> 37:05.670
To call it utter ruin
would be an understatement.

37:05.670 --> 37:06.670
So

37:07.400 --> 37:09.510
you refused to marry Xue Qinglan

37:10.510 --> 37:11.800
because of this?

37:11.920 --> 37:12.510
Yes.

37:13.630 --> 37:15.830
Of course, I don't like Miss Xue either.

37:16.710 --> 37:18.370
Mentor wants me to take a side,

37:18.550 --> 37:19.610
but I don't want to,

37:19.840 --> 37:20.840
and I can't.

37:21.760 --> 37:22.670
But you are still

37:22.670 --> 37:24.590
the Senior Grand Secretary's student.

37:24.590 --> 37:25.390
Everyone says

37:25.800 --> 37:27.200
you belong to

37:28.190 --> 37:29.250
the Fu faction.

37:29.360 --> 37:30.490
That's only for now.

37:32.030 --> 37:32.670
Do you...

37:35.920 --> 37:37.000
In any case,

37:37.360 --> 37:38.110
I cannot marry

37:38.110 --> 37:40.040
the woman Mentor wants me to marry.

37:40.510 --> 37:41.480
But if I marry

37:41.480 --> 37:42.280
someone else,

37:42.550 --> 37:44.810
Mentor would definitely be displeased.

37:44.960 --> 37:46.220
But Zhao is different.

37:46.880 --> 37:47.470
First,

37:48.000 --> 37:48.960
Mentor already knows

37:48.960 --> 37:50.420
the Ji family works for me,

37:50.710 --> 37:51.230
and Zhao and I

37:51.230 --> 37:52.510
have feelings for each other,

37:52.510 --> 37:54.400
so he would have no grounds to object.

37:54.400 --> 37:55.070
Second,

37:56.070 --> 37:58.550
the Chen and Ji families
are already tied by interests,

37:58.550 --> 38:00.030
so Zhao would not betray me.

38:00.030 --> 38:01.000
If I marry Zhao,

38:01.190 --> 38:01.960
she represents

38:01.960 --> 38:03.560
no factional power in court,

38:04.000 --> 38:04.840
so no one

38:04.840 --> 38:06.170
would feel threatened.

38:07.840 --> 38:08.480
Third,

38:08.920 --> 38:10.460
I like her.

38:10.840 --> 38:12.640
Then naturally I must marry her.

38:13.000 --> 38:14.440
After all this talk,

38:16.290 --> 38:18.570
you are going to marry her anyway.

38:23.760 --> 38:24.630
Mother.

38:24.960 --> 38:26.230
Jiuheng is right.

38:26.630 --> 38:27.230
This isn't just

38:27.230 --> 38:28.440
about his career.

38:28.800 --> 38:30.660
It also affects our whole family.

38:30.960 --> 38:31.440
Wait.

38:32.400 --> 38:34.800
When did you start to fancy her?

38:35.440 --> 38:37.320
You two haven't had much...

38:39.440 --> 38:42.970
Could it be that you fell for her
at her coming-of-age ceremony?

38:43.170 --> 38:44.440
No, not that soon.

38:47.960 --> 38:50.030
Alright, alright.

38:52.070 --> 38:53.760
I don't want to ask anymore.

38:54.590 --> 38:56.880
Do whatever you want.

39:03.710 --> 39:04.770
Thank you, Mother.

39:05.030 --> 39:05.760
Then I

39:06.070 --> 39:08.200
will have someone propose right away.

39:20.490 --> 39:24.010
[The Penal Court]

39:29.700 --> 39:34.050
[The Cold Iron Judge]

39:30.960 --> 39:32.290
How bold of you

39:32.510 --> 39:34.370
to trespass into the Penal Court.

39:39.880 --> 39:41.180
Your men may be fierce,

39:41.800 --> 39:43.330
but I just said one thing...

39:43.440 --> 39:44.320
and guess what?

39:44.630 --> 39:46.490
They didn't dare stop me anymore.

39:46.880 --> 39:47.810
What did you say?

39:48.760 --> 39:49.940
I'm considering

39:50.110 --> 39:52.110
whether to be the Commander's wife.

40:06.090 --> 40:11.490
[The Cold Iron Judge]

40:06.670 --> 40:07.840
The walls in your office

40:07.840 --> 40:08.970
are too thin.

40:09.630 --> 40:10.280
I can hear

40:10.280 --> 40:11.480
everything clearly.

40:17.110 --> 40:18.510
Normally, you couldn't.

40:19.440 --> 40:21.580
I had an interrogation room

40:22.030 --> 40:22.920
moved up here.

40:26.000 --> 40:26.960
Good idea.

40:27.320 --> 40:28.780
You really are different.

40:29.530 --> 40:30.590
Is there something wrong with you?

40:30.590 --> 40:31.510
I fancy you.

40:32.250 --> 40:33.320
What is wrong

40:33.320 --> 40:34.580
with saying it openly?

40:34.760 --> 40:35.990
Why must I hide it?

40:48.360 --> 40:49.090
What is this?

40:49.480 --> 40:51.710
This is medicine for my heart condition.

40:51.710 --> 40:53.240
You have a heart condition?

40:55.630 --> 40:56.630
Since childhood.

40:58.590 --> 40:59.720
Since the age of six,

40:59.960 --> 41:01.510
I was given all kinds of poison

41:01.510 --> 41:03.170
under the guise of treatment.

41:03.440 --> 41:05.590
No physician has ever
been able to cure me.

41:05.590 --> 41:06.510
My days

41:06.590 --> 41:08.440
are numbered.

41:09.510 --> 41:10.230
I heard

41:11.150 --> 41:12.840
you were widowed once before.

41:13.550 --> 41:15.610
If you've grown fond of being a widow,

41:15.670 --> 41:17.330
then just keep clinging to me.

41:21.510 --> 41:22.840
You asked about me?

41:43.320 --> 41:44.400
You're interested in me too,

41:44.400 --> 41:45.110
aren't you?

41:46.710 --> 41:47.510
Get out.

42:04.440 --> 42:05.320
Ye Xian.

42:08.510 --> 42:10.280
Do you like Gu Jinzhao?

42:14.190 --> 42:15.650
I had someone look into it.

42:16.320 --> 42:17.960
You've had a cold temperament
since childhood

42:17.960 --> 42:19.670
and never liked getting close to others.

42:19.670 --> 42:22.200
Yet you alone kept
in contact with Gu Jinzhao.

42:22.880 --> 42:24.890
You even helped her raise

42:25.110 --> 42:25.800
a cat.

42:28.020 --> 42:28.630
Get lost.

42:28.280 --> 42:30.060
[The Cold Iron Judge]

42:29.030 --> 42:29.670
Get lost!

43:01.990 --> 43:05.640
[A Splendid Match]
